<title>USA: New York Life sold $4.4 bln stable value products.</title>
<headline>New York Life sold $4.4 bln stable value products.</headline>
<dateline>PARSIPPANY, N.J. 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>New York Life Insurance Co said Wednesday it sold $4.39 billion of stable value products in 1996, a 13.6 percent increase from the $3.86 billion  sold in 1995.</p>
<p>The company's stable value group provides investment contracts and related products to 401(k) and other contribution-based retirement plans.</p>
